    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Live the night!</h2> <br><strong>Open your own nightclub and turn it into the city\u2019s #1 joint.</strong> Choose your character and step into an entrancing world of clubbing presented from a first-person perspective. Run your joint at night and prepare for another night during the day. The competition never sleeps, so do everything to wow your patrons and make them come back. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1621900/extras/e620823f19a4c0bf65c1a3e5c010b1fa.poster.avif?t=1729086592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1621900/extras/e620823f19a4c0bf65c1a3e5c010b1fa.webm?t=1729086592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">It\u2019s your bar.</h2> Shape its vibe. From choosing the music to decorating the place to hiring the right bouncers, bartenders and dancers, you always have a free hand. Make business acquaintances, stock up the place and step in when things get rough between your patrons. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1621900/extras/7177d17d218993afebd9246afc89d1e1.poster.avif?t=1729086592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1621900/extras/7177d17d218993afebd9246afc89d1e1.webm?t=1729086592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In this world, every NPC has a purpose.</h2> Talk with them. Get their feedback. Read between the lines and discover how to improve the place to make your patrons happy. Storylines will form. Character arcs will develop. You will be the driving force behind it.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1621900/extras/18c181219589113bebf23ab06ac20dea.poster.avif?t=1729086592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1621900/extras/18c181219589113bebf23ab06ac20dea.webm?t=1729086592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1621900/extras/18c181219589113bebf23ab06ac20dea.mp4?t=1729086592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Tough night? Take a break from being a boss. From casting your dancers to mixing your drinks, there\u2019s always something fun to be done.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1621900/extras/7abc5a662f9965ae7a3886ea6a8728d6.poster.avif?t=1729086592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1621900/extras/7abc5a662f9965ae7a3886ea6a8728d6.webm?t=1729086592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1621900/extras/7abc5a662f9965ae7a3886ea6a8728d6.mp4?t=1729086592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Manage a nightclub and expand into a chain.<br></li><li>Design the interior and run the business from the floor.<br></li><li>Hire diverse staff and participate in dancer casting.<br></li><li>Run your errands by exploring a part of the city.<br></li><li>Use the day-night cycle  to prepare for the evenings.<br></li><li>Interact with NPCs with their own stories, moods and expectations.<br></li><li>Have fun with minigames testing your reflexes and wits.</li></ul>",
